00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:08.814
because of the way you're interpreting the light is influencing how you interpreting

191
00:13:08.864 --> 00:13:10.264
what's-- OK.

192
00:13:11.072 --> 00:13:17.022
So that's simply a consequence, as far as people understand that, that the source of

