00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:43.950
make certain assumptions about how we interpret the world.

198
00:13:44.000 --> 00:13:48.310
And that drives everything that we see and how we act upon what we see.

199
00:13:48.360 --> 00:13:52.790
So at a slightly higher or more conceptual level, I need your help.

